{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","title":"Orbit Kitchen Pantry Sync","type":"project","lobe":"kitchen","parent":"projects/orbit-kitchen","desc":"Barcode and receipt import that keeps the pantry list honest without manual entry.","intro":"Barcode and receipt import that keeps the pantry list honest without manual entry.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-17","synapses":["projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#1","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#2","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#3","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#4","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#5","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#6","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#7","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#8","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#9","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#10","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#11","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#12","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#13","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#14"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/96fd9a50-2e5e-4db0-b6c3-5a209175b880","pplx://sessions/f23fb8ad-e27b-d2a3-b868-f345a2f80041","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/33","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/42"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Forbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","parent":{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen","title":"Orbit Kitchen","type":"project","lobe":"kitchen","parent":null,"desc":"Orbit Kitchen is a weekly meal planner that rotates recipes by season, pantry stock and leftover windows.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-14","synapses":20,"sources":4,"children":6,"links":11,"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Forbit-kitchen","api":"api/projects/v1/pages/projects~2forbit-kitchen.json"},"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#1","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Pantry list merges after a grocery run","text":"pantry list changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check after a grocery run is bounded evidence, not proof that the seasonal rotation works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/orbit-kitchen-grocery-runs"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/f23fb8ad-e27b-d2a3-b868-f345a2f80041","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/33"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#2","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Aisle order is not acceptance","text":"aisle order changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check after a grocery run is bounded evidence, not proof that the dietary flag works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/f23fb8ad-e27b-d2a3-b868-f345a2f80041"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#3","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Reusable dietary flag","text":"the receipt import is derived from the dietary flag each Sunday; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/f23fb8ad-e27b-d2a3-b868-f345a2f80041"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#4","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Leftover window is not acceptance","text":"the store split is derived from the leftover window after a grocery run; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/orbit-kitchen-leftover-windows"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/f23fb8ad-e27b-d2a3-b868-f345a2f80041","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/33"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#5","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"No silent store split changes","text":"an earlier draft treated the store split as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#6","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Honest leftover window limits","text":"the leftover window archives after a grocery run, but this does not establish dietary flag acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/42","pplx://sessions/96fd9a50-2e5e-4db0-b6c3-5a209175b880"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#7","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Protected budget estimate","text":"an earlier draft treated the budget estimate as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/42"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#8","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Separate pantry list ownership","text":"the pantry list archives per household, but this does not establish dietary flag acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#9","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Default-off seasonal rotation","text":"the seasonal rotation nudges in the demo, but this does not establish unit normaliser acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/33"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#10","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"No silent leftover window changes","text":"an earlier draft treated the leftover window as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/96fd9a50-2e5e-4db0-b6c3-5a209175b880","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/33"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#11","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Reusable store split","text":"Sam chose to keep the store split and the leftover window distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/orbit-kitchen-grocery-runs"],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/42"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#12","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Receipt import is not acceptance","text":"the pantry list is derived from the receipt import per store; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/33"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#13","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Batch note with a visible gate","text":"an earlier draft treated the batch note as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/96fd9a50-2e5e-4db0-b6c3-5a209175b880"]},{"id":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync#14","page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","lead":"Honest unit normaliser limits","text":"Sam chose to keep the unit normaliser and the seasonal rotation distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/orbit-kitchen/pull/42","pplx://sessions/96fd9a50-2e5e-4db0-b6c3-5a209175b880"]}],"sources":[{"id":"pplx://sessions/96fd9a50-2e5e-4db0-b6c3-5a209175b880","label":"96fd9a50","kind":"session","pages":["projects/orbit-kitchen","projects/orbit-kitchen-pantry-sync","projects/orbit-kitchen-recipe-import",